# 每小时清理 job_event_log 中 24 小时前的**进度事件**（状态/控制类不删）
[Unit]
Description=Blockchain Platform job_event_log 进度事件保留清理（24h）
After=network-online.target docker.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
EnvironmentFile=/home/euripides/projects/blockchain-platform/deploy/.env
WorkingDirectory=/home/euripides/projects/blockchain-platform
ExecStart=/bin/bash /home/euripides/projects/blockchain-platform/scripts/ops/prune-job-event-log.sh
Nice=15